==English==

===Etymology===
Via {{uder|en|la|Aegaeum mare}}, from {{uder|en|grc|Αἰγαῖον πέλαγος|}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|əjē'ən sī}}, {{IPA|en|/əˈdʒi.ən ˈsi/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[Aegean]] [[sea|Sea]]}}

# A sea in the northeastern part of the [[Mediterranean Sea|Mediterranean]].

